{"seq":1,"slug":"why-curriculum-learning","title":"为何课程学习","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/curriculum-learning-strategies/foundations/why-curriculum-learning","wordCount":1588,"readingTime":7,"html":"<h1 id=\"为何课程学习\">为何课程学习</h1><p>随机梯度下降在理论上对样本顺序是&quot;健忘&quot;的：只要每个 epoch 把数据均匀随机打散，期望梯度就等于全量梯度，顺序信息在期望里被抹平。这让&quot;刻意排序样本能改善训练&quot;听起来像无稽之谈。然而 Bengio、Louradour、Collobert 和 Weston 在 2009 年的奠基论文里给出了反例——在形状识别与语言建模任务上，先喂简单样本、再逐步引入困难样本，比纯随机训练收敛更快、最终泛化更好。理解这个反例为何成立、又在何种条件下失效，是进入整个领域的钥匙。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>课程学习的核心主张可以压成一句话：<strong>在非凸优化里，样本的呈现顺序通过改变优化轨迹经过的局部极小区域，间接影响最终解的质量</strong>。SGD 的顺序无关性只在凸、且学习率趋于零的极限下严格成立；真实的深度网络损失面布满鞍点与宽窄不一的盆地，早期梯度步走向哪里，强烈依赖最初见到的是什么样本。先用低噪声、结构清晰的简单样本把参数推进一个&quot;好&quot;的盆地，再引入困难样本做精修，就可能避开被困难样本的大梯度过早带偏。</p>\n<p>下图勾勒课程学习区别于随机训练的三条因果链：</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;  A[由易到难的样本顺序] --&gt; B[早期梯度更平滑&lt;br/&gt;方差更小]&#10;  A --&gt; C[困难/含噪样本&lt;br/&gt;延后引入]&#10;  B --&gt; D[参数被导入&lt;br/&gt;更优的损失盆地]&#10;  C --&gt; E[噪声梯度不会&lt;br/&gt;过早主导更新]&#10;  D --&gt; F[更快收敛]&#10;  E --&gt; F&#10;  F --&gt; G[在某些条件下&lt;br/&gt;更好的泛化]&#10;  H[凸问题 / 超大模型 /&lt;br/&gt;难度度量不可靠] -.削弱.-&gt; G\">flowchart TD\n  A[由易到难的样本顺序] --&gt; B[早期梯度更平滑&lt;br/&gt;方差更小]\n  A --&gt; C[困难/含噪样本&lt;br/&gt;延后引入]\n  B --&gt; D[参数被导入&lt;br/&gt;更优的损失盆地]\n  C --&gt; E[噪声梯度不会&lt;br/&gt;过早主导更新]\n  D --&gt; F[更快收敛]\n  E --&gt; F\n  F --&gt; G[在某些条件下&lt;br/&gt;更好的泛化]\n  H[凸问题 / 超大模型 /&lt;br/&gt;难度度量不可靠] -.削弱.-&gt; G</pre><p>与随机训练、以及&quot;反课程&quot;（anti-curriculum，由难到易）相比，三者的取舍如下表：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>训练顺序</th>\n<th>早期梯度特征</th>\n<th>适用直觉</th>\n<th>主要风险</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>随机（baseline）</td>\n<td>方差恒定</td>\n<td>无先验、数据干净时最稳妥</td>\n<td>困难/噪声样本早期就干扰优化</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>由易到难（curriculum）</td>\n<td>早期低方差，渐增</td>\n<td>任务有清晰难度梯度、含噪</td>\n<td>难度度量错则导入坏盆地</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>由难到易（anti-curriculum）</td>\n<td>早期高方差</td>\n<td>需早期打破对称、避免欠拟合</td>\n<td>早期大梯度可能发散</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"三种互补的解释机制\">三种互补的解释机制</h2><p>为何&quot;易到难&quot;在某些场景有效，文献给出三套并不互斥的解释。其一是<strong>优化平滑</strong>视角：把课程看作一种延拓法（continuation method）——先优化一个把困难样本权重压低的&quot;光滑化&quot;目标，它的极小更容易找到，再逐步把目标形变回原始的、崎岖的全量目标。这正是 Bengio 等人的原始论证，课程被形式化为从光滑代理目标到真实目标的一族过渡。</p>\n<p>其二是<strong>梯度信噪比</strong>视角：困难样本（尤其是标注噪声大的样本）贡献的梯度方向往往不一致甚至冲突，早期就让它们参与会拉低有效信噪比。把它们延后，等模型已经从简单样本里学到稳定的特征表示，再引入时这些样本的梯度才更&quot;可解释&quot;。这条解释与样本加权、自步学习一脉相承，详见<a href=\"../difficulty/example-weighting\">样本加权</a>。</p>\n<p>其三是<strong>表示构建</strong>视角：简单样本通常共享更基础、可复用的特征（短句的语法、清晰图像的边缘），先学会这些底层特征，等于为理解困难样本搭好脚手架。这与人类教育里&quot;先掌握前置概念&quot;的直觉一致，也是&quot;curriculum&quot;这个词的由来。</p>\n<h2 id=\"边界条件-课程何时无用甚至有害\">边界条件：课程何时无用甚至有害</h2><p>诚实地讲，课程学习是一个<strong>效应脆弱</strong>的方法，它的收益在几类情况下迅速归零。第一，<strong>问题接近凸</strong>时——简单的线性/逻辑回归，顺序无关性几乎严格成立，课程毫无意义。第二，<strong>模型规模极大</strong>时——多项 2025 年的研究发现，课程对 LLM 预训练的增益随参数量增加而衰减，在最大规模上常常退化为噪声级别，一种解释是大模型本身容量足够，不需要&quot;脚手架&quot;。第三，也是最隐蔽的，<strong>难度度量不可靠</strong>时——如果你的&quot;易/难&quot;标签其实是错的，课程会信心十足地把模型导向更坏的盆地，比随机还差。</p>\n<p>下式刻画了一个理想化的判据：设课程带来的优化增益为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>G</mi><mtext>opt</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">G_\\text{opt}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">G</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">opt</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>，难度度量误差引入的偏置损失为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>L</mi><mtext>bias</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">L_\\text{bias}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">bias</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>，则课程净收益约为</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>G</mi><mtext>opt</mtext></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mtext>非凸度</mtext><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mtext>噪声率</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>L</mi><mtext>bias</mtext></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mtext>度量误差</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\Delta = G_\\text{opt}(\\text{非凸度}, \\text{噪声率}) - L_\\text{bias}(\\text{度量误差})</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">Δ</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0361em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">G</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">opt</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">非凸度</span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">噪声率</span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">bias</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">度量误差</span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>当模型增大使非凸度的&quot;可利用空间&quot;缩小、或度量误差升高时，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\Delta</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">Δ</span></span></span></span></span> 可由正转负。这解释了为何同一套课程在小模型上有效、搬到大模型上失效——这不是实现 bug，而是机制本身的规模依赖。关于这些负结果的系统梳理，见<a href=\"../practice/curriculum-pitfalls\">陷阱与负结果</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"与相邻概念的界分\">与相邻概念的界分</h2><p>课程学习常被与三个邻居混淆，划清边界有助于聚焦。它<strong>不是</strong>学习率调度——后者调的是&quot;步子多大&quot;，属于<a href=\"../dl-training-optimization/optimizers/lr-scheduling\">学习率调度</a>的范畴，虽然一个好的学习率热身有时会吞掉课程的部分收益（见陷阱篇）。它<strong>不是</strong>数据筛选——筛选决定&quot;用不用某条数据&quot;，课程决定&quot;何时用&quot;，前者属于<a href=\"../data-centric-ai/synthetic/data-selection-pruning\">数据中心 AI</a>。它也<strong>不是</strong>持续学习——持续学习里顺序是环境强加的、目标是不遗忘旧任务，课程里顺序是我们主动设计的、目标是学得更好，二者方向相反。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>SGD 的顺序无关性只在凸极限下成立；真实深度网络的非凸损失面让样本顺序能通过改变优化轨迹影响最终解。</li>\n<li>课程有效的三套解释互补：优化平滑（延拓法）、梯度信噪比、表示构建脚手架。</li>\n<li>净收益 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>G</mi><mtext>opt</mtext></msub><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>L</mi><mtext>bias</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\Delta = G_\\text{opt} - L_\\text{bias}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">Δ</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">G</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">opt</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">bias</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>：非凸度高、噪声大、难度度量准时为正；接近凸、模型极大、度量不准时可转负甚至有害。</li>\n<li>课程不等于学习率调度、数据筛选或持续学习——它专管&quot;何时用哪条样本&quot;这一个旋钮。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"延伸阅读\">延伸阅读</h2><ul>\n<li>本 hub：<a href=\"difficulty-ordering\">难度排序原理</a> 把&quot;难度&quot;概念化、<a href=\"curriculum-taxonomy\">课程范式谱系</a> 给出方法地图、<a href=\"../practice/curriculum-pitfalls\">陷阱与负结果</a> 详述边界条件。</li>\n<li>跨 hub：<a href=\"../dl-training-optimization/optimizers/lr-scheduling\">学习率调度</a>（区分课程与步长调度）、<a href=\"../data-centric-ai/synthetic/data-selection-pruning\">数据选择与剪枝</a>（区分课程与筛选）。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"为何课程学习","id":"为何课程学习"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"三种互补的解释机制","id":"三种互补的解释机制"},{"level":2,"text":"边界条件：课程何时无用甚至有害","id":"边界条件-课程何时无用甚至有害"},{"level":2,"text":"与相邻概念的界分","id":"与相邻概念的界分"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"},{"level":2,"text":"延伸阅读","id":"延伸阅读"}],"prev":null,"next":{"title":"难度排序原理","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/curriculum-learning-strategies/foundations/difficulty-ordering"}}